WEBVTT

1
00:00:04,850 --> 00:00:08,050
In my previous life, I relied on my professional knowledge

2
00:00:08,050 --> 00:00:09,170
Saved Lu Ling

3
00:00:09,170 --> 00:00:12,530
It was also me who carried Lu Ling down the mountain step by step.

4
00:00:12,530 --> 00:00:15,730
When Lu Ling woke up, she fell in love with Song Jingyi at first sight

5
00:00:15,730 --> 00:00:18,450
Consider Song Jingyi his savior

6
00:00:18,450 --> 00:00:20,610
Since then, a fierce pursuit has begun

7
00:00:20,610 --> 00:00:23,330
I am the real savior if you don't care at all

8
00:00:23,330 --> 00:00:25,870
You are my savior, right?

9
00:00:25,870 --> 00:00:27,890
I will repay you well

10
00:00:27,890 --> 00:00:30,450
Mr. Lu is that lady

11
00:00:30,450 --> 00:00:35,490
Even if Song Jingyi gets angry with her and disappears in the future,

12
00:00:35,490 --> 00:00:37,410
Luling also blamed me

13
00:00:37,490 --> 00:00:38,690
You are her best friend

14
00:00:38,690 --> 00:00:39,970
Why don't you take a fancy to her?

15
00:00:39,970 --> 00:00:41,650
If something happens to Lu Ling

16
00:00:41,650 --> 00:00:46,750
I want you not to be able to see the sun tomorrow

17
00:00:46,750 --> 00:00:48,670
The savior is saving you

18
00:00:48,670 --> 00:00:51,150
How can you close your eyes and act as if nothing happened?

19
00:00:51,150 --> 00:00:55,650
How rude. You're awake. You're hurt.

20
00:00:55,650 --> 00:00:56,770
I'll bandage it for you again

21
00:00:56,770 --> 00:00:57,890
Don't move
